  "_commit": {
    "id": "078f8c383cab774d4814a3e48903992becfdbc17",
    "author": "Ossama Edbali <ossedb@gmail.com>",
    "committer": "Ossama Edbali <ossedb@gmail.com>",
    "message": "fix: support layered writers through the manifest and native-run API (#9)\n\n- Native runs record their path relative to the dataset, so a dataset\n  can be moved or written in a staging directory and renamed into place.\n- spectrum_index is written as int64, the type of an mzPeak archive's\n  index column, by the data, Spectra and mzr writers.\n- createMsBackendParquetDataset(data = ) writes only the columns data\n  carries; absent or all-NA core variables are no longer materialised.\n- writeManifest() serialises its generation check and rename with a\n  mzStack.json.lock directory and raises mzstack_conflict for a held\n  lock or a changed generation, with unchanged messages.\n- New mzstack_reference condition for a declared source dataset that\n  cannot be located or read, or has a different uid.\n- Version 0.99.10.\n",
    "time": 1794495748
  },
